    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 01</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Start with 80-GSM heavy-duty air-bubble wrap for all fragile items. This specific gauge provides superior shock absorption compared to standard packing materials, effectively dampening the repetitive vibrations encountered on the uneven stretches of the National Highway.</p>
