    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Construct robust corrugated fiberboard crating for irregularly shaped or high-value items. These custom-built boxes provide structural rigidity that standard cartons cannot match. The double-wall construction distributes weight evenly and prevents crushing under the pressure of stacked loads.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
