    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Packers and movers must create e-Way bills for every consignment being transported between states.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 02</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The e-Way bills are generated electronically through the GST portal and must be cited on the consignment papers.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Protocol 03</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Packers and movers are responsible for ensuring the timely and accurate generation of e-Way bills.</p>
  </div>
</div>

	<p>In addition to GST e-Way bills, packers and movers must also provide IBA-approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty) to ensure a hassle-free transportation process. IBA stands for Insurance and Banking Association, which is an organization that establishes guidelines for packers and movers to follow.</p>

	<ul>
		<li>IBA-approved Lorry Receipts serve as a proof of transportation and document the details of your consignment.</li>
		<li>These receipts ensure the safety and secure transportation of your goods during the journey.</li>
		<li>IBA-approved Lorry Receipts are mandatory for packers and movers and are crucial for interstate transportation.</li>
</ul>

	<p>In case of any unfortunate incidents during the transportation of your household goods, comprehensive IRDAI (Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India) marine transit insurance provides a comprehensive coverage for your belongings.</p>

	<ul>
		<li>IRDAI marine transit insurance offers 100% declared-value protection for your household goods.</li>
		<li>In case of damage or loss during transportation, this insurance policy helps you claim compensation.</li>
		<li>Packing and moving companies must provide comprehensive IRDAI marine transit insurance to ensure your peace of mind.</li>
</ul>

	<h3>Importance of Choosing a Reliable Moving Company</h3>
	<p>Selecting a reliable and experienced packing and moving company is crucial for hassle-free transportation of your possessions.</p></div>
